(text "thriller: root-of-trust platform, PG2L50H-6IFBG484 + QSPI flash + ATECC608C\n\nPower: 5 V always on -> 3V3_AO (RTC, secure element, power control).\nEN_PWR (button | RTC alarm | PWR_HOLD) -> 1V0 -> 1V8 -> 3V3 -> PGOOD -> 5V_SW.\nAll I/O banks at 3.3 V. Parts chosen from LCSC stock; LCSC numbers are in the LCSC field.\nSymbols: thriller.kicad_sym (project library). Nets between pages use global labels." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 25 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bcfa5bcb-f269-5874-aff5-abcb6e8190bf"))
